# Queue live files

App DB in `database/production-design-queue-manager/`. Settings + Input in app folder; Logs/Output are warehouse-root. SharedInbox stays warehouse-shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `database/production-design-queue-manager/Configuration Workbook.xlsx` | Pocket / Override Print Size; Skip Batches |
| `Production Design Queue Manager/config/queue_app_settings.json` | Design folders + DTF Queues folder + last paths |
| `database/shared/custom_label/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | Print sizes (Width/Height mm) |
| `Production Design Queue Manager/Input/` (+ Missing Size Reference) | App-local intake I/O |
| `Output/Production Design Queue Manager/` | Design Queues PNGs |
| `Logs/Production Design Queue Manager/` | Queue run logs |
| `runtime/SharedInbox/DTF Des/` | Design Queues watcher input |
